stop  competing on price if you want to have a  long-term  sustainable advantage drive money into  your company  into your wallet then you can't compete  on price  you have to find another way to stand  out and charge a premium  for what you're doing if you want to  have success in the long term as an  entrepreneur  otherwise it's a race to the bottom  you're always competing on thin margins  and you're never going to have success  as a business owner hi i'm evan  carmichael i believe that hungry  entrepreneurs deserve help  and today i'm answering a question from  a youtube viewer  love you guys youtube viewer lac1212iv  whatever that means wrote in hey evan i  have started a service business that is  specialized in window cleaning  it's so hard to get customers i have all  the professional equipment and i do not  charge much what's a good way to get  customers  so first of all you've told me nothing  about your business  you're a window cleaner that's great  there's tons of window cleaners  i don't want you competing on price if  you get customers who are always beating  you down on price  you're going to end up working for  minimum wage or less  it's not going to be worth your time  you're going to get stressed out you're  going to feel defeated  and you're going to think hey you know  what it's better and less stressful to  go out and get a job  you have to find a way to stand out as a  window cleaner  what's wrong with most window cleaning  companies i don't know  you have to tell me what makes you  different why should i hire  you over every other window cleaning  company or over doing it myself  you have to communicate that message you  have to come up with it yourself  know what makes you stand out and it has  to be real it's got to be something that  you feel  you have to get into this business  because you feel that the other winning  cleaning companies  they suck they're all doing it wrong  there's a huge  hole in the marketplace and you're going  to jump in and solve it  if you're just getting into window  cleaning because you think it's an  opportunity to make a quick buck  it's not gonna happen stop now go back  and get a job  you have to love cleaning windows you  have to bring something that nobody else  is doing  and use that in all your messaging what  is different  about your window cleaning company that  people would want to pay a premium for  versus everybody else that's out there  instead of struggling over price and  competing with everybody at the bottom  you have to separate yourself and come  up and it has to be tangible it's got to  be real there has to be something that's  different especially unique about what  you do  and communicate that in every  conversation  with potential customers or anybody who  could potentially help your business  when you wrote to me you wrote just to  say  i have a window cleaning business and i  have professional equipment  that means nothing to me this is your  opportunity to tell guys like me  why you are different what is wrong with  the market  how can you fix it that nobody else can  do it and what's the benefit to me  make me care and if i believe in it  strongly enough  then price will be my last concern and  those are the clients that you want to  get out  and they'll be your best clients they'll  be repeat clients  they'll bring on more business for you  they'll refer their friends to you  and that's the way to build a successful  service based business  i know it's hard i know when you're  first starting up it's hard you want to  get your first customers you're trying  to do everything yourself things are  overwhelming but this is  really really important like this you  have to care about  you have to be in this business for a  reason not just to make money  and maybe you have that reason already  and it's just not coming out and how you  communicate it  but it's so important to have that  message  if you don't you're not going to build a  hugely successful company and i want  that for you i want you to have a  company that you can  hang your hat on and say i built that  i'm proud of what i did you want to go  to work every day feeling great about  what you're doing  so get your messaging down good luck  communicate it to everybody  and you will get more business for those  of you watching you like the video  please give it a thumbs up below it  makes me want to do more for you  and i want to hear from you what do you  think about this video  leave it in the comment section below i  always read those i really love seeing  those come in  even if you've left a comment before  leave another one it makes my morning  really every time i see them come in  and if you have a question for your own  company i'd love to try to answer it for  you  if you leave in the comment section  below thank you guys see you soon

